'''Frostfire Sword''' is a version of [[Nord Sword]] upgraded with a [[Frostfire Essence]]. It loses a small amount of [[Slash|slash damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* The primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit. No damage penalty against multiple targets.
* Its secondary attack deals 3x damage with a slightly longer reach.

An upgraded Nord Sword will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Frostfire Sword.

